              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Teresa Myers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was fantastic!! Very moist and tasty ♥️ Because we like oysters we did 2 12 ounce jars and added the oyster liquor, mushrooms celery, salt pepper, celery seed. Topped with the bacon. Baked covered for 15 then uncovered 30 miutes. I did find that it needed to bake longer. I even bumped the oven to 375 for the last 15 minutes. Unfortunately my picture does not do it justice. It was yummy! Teresa",
